name issue_18_random_loss_keyframes
describe 5% random loss: NACK repairs it, so the receiver asks for at most a few keyframes (renamed from issue_18_lntf_not_pli, which no longer exercises LNTF: the bench sends none for H.264; #23)
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=40ms jitter=3ms loss=5% queue=300ms
expect video.keyframe_requests <= 3
# PR #324 (#84's flip, quality scaling on): was < 1000. Provisional lock, tracked to #376: ours 1313 on seed 1, libwebrtc worst seed 1-10 769 (mean 472).
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 1450
expect audio.interruptions == 0
